{"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"relationshipsSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"title":"Conforms To","type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A picker allowing to expose several "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"filter chips","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" and proposing single or multiple selections."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSChipPicker"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tag"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Hashable","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Each chip contains a “tag”, i.e. a supposed to be unique value.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker will expose choosen values through this “tag”.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It has also some configuration elements which will override the one applied to nested ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSFilterChip","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Accessibility-considerations","text":"Accessibility considerations"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Voice Over","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" will use several elements to describe the component.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The picker itself does no have any defined accessiiblity value, label or identifier ; it remains in the users hands to define which one will be used.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"However if defined in the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPickerData","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" the items inside the picker will have such accessibility identifiers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Define the elements to display in filter chip using OUDSChipPickerData.","    enum Drink: String, CaseIterable {","        case virginHolyLava, ipaBeer, mineralWater","    }","","    var someDataToPopulate: [OUDSChipPickerData<Drink>] {","        [","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.virginHolyLava,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"Virgin Holy Lava\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"flame\")))),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.ipaBeer,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"IPA Beer\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"dog.fill\")))),","","            OUDSChipPickerData(tag: Drink.mineralWater,","                               layout: .textAndImage(\"Mineral water\", image: OUDSImage(asset: Image(systemName: \"waterbottle.fill\")))),","        ]","    }","","    \/\/\/ Single selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selection: Drink = .mineralWater","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selection: $selection, chips: someDataToPopulate)","","    \/\/\/ Multiple selection case","","    \/\/ Prepare the selection, with a value previously selected","    \/\/ Use the data and the binding for the picker.","    @State var selections: [Drink] = [.mineralWater]","","    \/\/ Here the picker with title, selection and data","    OUDSChipPicker(title: \"Select a drink\", selections: $selections, chips: someDataToPopulate)"]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Design-documentation","text":"Design documentation"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"There is no online specification as this component is not an official OUDS one.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Theme-rendering","text":"Theme rendering"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange","text":"Orange"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Orange","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Orange-Compact","text":"Orange Compact"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_OrangeCompact","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Sosh","text":"Sosh"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"component_chipPicker_Sosh","type":"image"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Wireframe","text":"Wireframe"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"image","identifier":"component_chipPicker_Wireframe"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Since","type":"aside","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.17.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-7xdsd","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:selection:chips:itemsSpacing:)-8w8zd","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(title:selections:chips:itemsSpacing:)","doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents\/OUDSChipPicker\/init(t